# Bristlepack Sentry: it fulfils its own condition when its power reaches 4 (Bristlepack Sentry's 2024-04-12 ruling). Giant Growth on T3 makes it a
# 6/6, so it can attack as though it didn't have defender and deals 6 combat damage.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Bristlepack Sentry
Giant Growth
Forest x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Bristlepack Sentry.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Giant Growth.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Bristlepack Sentry)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Bristlepack Sentry.Power = 6
Bot1.Attack(Bristlepack Sentry > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 14
